return {
    ["%s，好久不见：\n      我听说了你最近与舞王狒哥艰辛的交战。辛苦了，你一直都很努力。我和苏茜搜集了一些有关舞王狒哥的情报，希望能有所帮助：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302107\">舞王狒哥的记载</>\n      你所承受的命运写满了未知与危险，连我们也无法勘破你身上的迷雾和谜团。未来或许还有更多的险境、更大的危机在等待着我们。我们都需要变得更强，才能保护好自己和珍视的事物。但当你疲惫的时候，欢迎随时来命运咖啡厅坐坐，我这里有不错的红茶和糕点，或许你会喜欢。闲暇的时候，可以来陪我和苏茜聊聊天，让心态平和下来，一切都会好起来的。\n      不用担心，我和其他人都会尽力帮助你，随信附上一些提升实力的建议。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s, long time no see: \n      I heard about your recent arduous battle with the Dancing King Baboon Brother. You've worked hard; you have always been very diligent. Susie and I have gathered some intelligence regarding the Dancing King Baboon Brother, and I hope it proves helpful: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302107\">Records of the Dancing King Baboon Brother</>\n      The fate you bear is filled with unknowns and dangers; even we cannot pierce through the mist and mysteries surrounding you. Perhaps more perilous situations and greater crises await us in the future. We all need to become stronger to protect ourselves and the things we cherish. But when you are exhausted, you are always welcome to come to the Fate Café for a seat. I have some excellent black tea and pastries here that you might enjoy. In your spare time, feel free to come chat with Susie and me to calm your mind; everything will be alright. \n      Do not worry; I and the others will do our best to help you. Attached to this letter are some suggestions for improving your strength. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["*f**减速"] = "*f** Slow.",
    ["2个"] = "2 items",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【我要你鼠！】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8，前往{Location:[廷根(887,1338)]|-11259;33864;-2462;2;5200002;0}，观察<Assistant_Red>猫和老鼠</>接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【I Want You, Mouse!】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the Advancement Quest, then advance to Sequence 8, head to {Location:[Tingen(887,1338)]|-11259;33864;-2462;2;5200002;0}, and observe <Assistant_Red> Cat and Mouse </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
